// What Cammy does differently. She gets around like everybody else (movement_moves.hor) and starts from the same
// fighting moves (fighting_moves.hor, which is also where what all of this means is written down): the ones here
// replace the ones of the same name in there and add her own, see characters.hor.
//
// Her animations have fewer frames than those of The Man and play at half the rate, so every frame number in a
// phase is hers alone. And where he has one kick and one punch on two buttons each, she has a light and a heavy
// one of both, which turn into other moves when she is crouching or in the air:
//
//                 standing        crouching             in the air
//   A             kick            crouch_kick           jump_light_kick
//   B             heavy kick      sweep                 jump_kick
//   X             light punch     crouch_punch          jump_light_punch
//   Y             heavy punch     crouch_heavy_punch    jump_punch
//   A + B         cannon_drill, she throws herself at the other player feet first, spinning
//   X + Y         cannon_spike, a kick straight up that takes whoever it meets along
//   LeftBumper    spinning_knuckle, a turn on the spot into a backfist that carries her forwards

